              "Data": "A new help request for you\n\nHello,\n\nA new help request has been offered to you.\n\nSubject: Mathematics\n\nPlease accept it within 10 minutes; after that it is offered to another teacher.\n\nOpen the request in STOA: https://app.stoaedu.ch/teacher/requests/req-687\n\nYou can turn this reminder off in STOA's notification settings.\n\nKind regards\nYour STOA team\n\nSTOA · Learning support for school students\n\nZürich · info@stoaedu.ch · https://stoaedu.ch\n\nYou are receiving this email because STOA offers you help requests. Unsubscribe from these emails: https://app.stoaedu.ch/unsubscribe?token=eyJjIjoiZGlzcGF0Y2hfcmVtaW5kZXIiLCJrIjoiZGV2ZWxvcG1lbnQtdjEiLCJ1IjoidGVhY2hlci02ODcifQ._FX3ju7a48VOd0qL-0W4v-_ILQv4NVTEkl6MpnjL07Q\n"
